  "title": "Lamb Merguez Sausage Patties",
  "description": "Combine ground lamb with cumin, coriander, cinnamon, turmeric, garlic, and harissa sauce for a spicy, Merguez-style sausage perfect for burgers, breakfast, or any meal.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
